[{"key":"0mau5du1ukr30a","text":"Every move captures one of your own pieces. Each piece gets 2 captures. Kings are never captured."},{"key":"0ro2pgr1nqz8x7","text":"The bishop lives on light squares, but the star is on a light square. Never!"},{"key":"13gjrlv0uykc95","text":"Knight against three pawns! Catch every pawn before one reaches your side."},{"key":"1dic2cy074g5vc","text":"Keep the king in the box and make it smaller. Bring your king to help!"},{"key":"18d7cia1b830be","text":"The bishop and the star are both on dark squares. She can get there!"},{"key":"17shv8r1qguuu9","text":"The king can't move, but nobody attacks him. Stalemate: it's a tie!"},{"key":"05qjqao00am4sw","text":"Capture every enemy piece. Stop the pawns from reaching your side!"},{"key":"1e4unld0r0fiqn","text":"The knight attacks the king. That's check! He can still get away."},{"key":"0s8qa7s1dqn07a","text":"This is the knight. Like me! I hop funny: two steps and a turn!"},{"key":"1v0i9gd03xf1u7","text":"Use the rook to fence the king in, and walk your king closer."},{"key":"0bf1ut308iu0rv","text":"Who can munch the cookie pawn? Tap them ALL, then press Done!"},{"key":"0mgdefb0mam30l","text":"The rooks alternate: one cuts off a rank, the other checks."},{"key":"1p8ha8m0ds0jca","text":"Up-and-down lines are files. Side-to-side lines are ranks."},{"key":"0kpbibv1bkrbwl","text":"One rook guards a row, the other gives check. Then swap!"},{"key":"10yytf30kpd939","text":"Chess board: tap every piece that can capture the cookie"},{"key":"0686qks107smge","text":"Detective Pip! Check, checkmate, stalemate, or all fine?"},{"key":"1v0wf7n1sxnt9n","text":"That's not check yet. Which piece can attack the king?"},{"key":"09volbo1aov36e","text":"Careful! The king could gobble your knight. Try again!"},{"key":"10o5qmx1bmoo2t","text":"Wow, three perfect in a row! Want to try a Super Star?"},{"key":"0rfovco0h6dg1c","text":"Hop found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"005m5lb09h28iz","text":"